libheif pull request #1503 ("Add support for handling 'tmap' items", github.com/strukturag/libheif),
from the rebase at github.com/fxthomas/libheif, branch pr/1503-gain-maps-v1.23.1, re-diffed
against libheif 1.23.4 with one fix: get_unused_item_id() returns a Result<> since 1.23.2, so the
altr group id is unwrapped (and its error returned). Used by build.sh in this directory.

